ADDITIONAL HARDWARE NOTICE

This software communicates with battery hardware over an undocumented,
reverse-engineered protocol. Incorrect use can permanently and irreparably
disable a power station, and may void its warranty.

The disclaimer above applies in full to physical damage to hardware and
property, not only to loss of data or software malfunction. You use this
software entirely at your own risk.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by AFERIY,
Sydpower, Fossibot, or any related company. Product names are used only to
identify the hardware with which this software is compatible.
